---
import { ShieldCheck, Zap, Lock, Cpu, ArrowUpRight, CheckCircle2, Sparkles } from 'lucide-react';
---

<section id="about" class="w-full py-16 sm:py-24 relative overflow-hidden">
  {/* Subtle Ambient Background Gradients */}
  <div class="pointer-events-none absolute top-1/2 left-0 -translate-y-1/2 w-96 h-96 bg-cyan-600/10 rounded-full blur-3xl -z-10" />
  <div class="pointer-events-none absolute top-1/3 right-0 w-96 h-96 bg-indigo-600/10 rounded-full blur-3xl -z-10" />

  <div class="w-full max-w-6xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 space-y-20 sm:space-y-28">
    
    {/* Section Header */}
    <div class="text-center max-w-2xl mx-auto space-y-3">
      <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-full bg-[#0D1426] border border-white/10 px-3.5 py-1 text-xs font-mono text-[#38BDF8]">
        <Sparkles class="h-3.5 w-3.5 text-[#38BDF8]" />
        <span>ABOUT NOVATOOLS</span>
      </div>
      <h2 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl lg:text-4xl font-extrabold tracking-tight text-white">
        Engineered for Privacy. <span class="bg-gradient-to-r from-sky-200 via-cyan-300 to-blue-400 bg-clip-text text-transparent">Built for Speed.</span>
      </h2>
      <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-[#94A3B8] leading-relaxed">
        Why sacrifice confidentiality for convenience? NovaTools delivers studio-grade media and PDF utilities without a single byte ever touching remote cloud servers.
      </p>
    </div>

    {/* STORY BLOCK 1: Left Image, Right Text */}
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-8 lg:gap-12 items-center">
      
      {/* Left Column: Real Application Screenshot */}
      <div class="lg:col-span-6 relative group">
        <div class="relative rounded-2xl border border-white/10 bg-[#0A0F1D]/80 backdrop-blur-xl p-2 sm:p-2.5 shadow-2xl shadow-cyan-950/30 overflow-hidden transition-all duration-300 group-hover:border-cyan-500/30">
          {/* Subtle Window Header */}
          <div class="flex items-center gap-1.5 px-3 py-2 border-b border-white/5 bg-[#050811]/60 rounded-t-xl mb-1.5">
            <span class="h-2.5 w-2.5 rounded-full bg-red-500/60" />
            <span class="h-2.5 w-2.5 rounded-full bg-amber-500/60" />
            <span class="h-2.5 w-2.5 rounded-full bg-emerald-500/60" />
            <span class="ml-2 font-mono text-[10px] text-slate-400">novatools.app/console</span>
          </div>

          <img
            src="/screenshots/1_novatools_console_overview.jpg"
            alt="NovaTools Private Document and Media Workspace"
            class="w-full h-auto rounded-xl object-cover border border-white/5 shadow-inner"
            loading="lazy"
          />
        </div>
      </div>

      {/* Right Column: Copy & Narrative */}
      <div class="lg:col-span-6 space-y-5 text-left">
        <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 text-xs font-mono font-semibold tracking-wider text-cyan-400 uppercase">
          <Lock class="h-3.5 w-3.5 text-cyan-400" />
          <span>Complete Data Sovereignty</span>
        </div>

        <h3 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight text-white leading-tight">
          Your Files Never Touch a Cloud Server
        </h3>

        <p class="text-sm text-[#94A3B8] leading-relaxed">
          Traditional online file converters force you to upload sensitive contracts, medical records, financial statements, and private footage to remote infrastructure. Even when platforms promise deletion, files linger in server cache and network transit.
        </p>

        <p class="text-sm text-[#94A3B8] leading-relaxed">
          NovaTools eliminates that risk entirely. Every file decoding, PDF merge, image compression, and audio boost happens exclusively inside your local browser memory.
        </p>

        {/* Feature Checkpoints */}
        <div class="space-y-2.5 pt-2">
          <div class="flex items-start gap-2.5 text-xs text-slate-200">
            <CheckCircle2 class="h-4 w-4 text-[#34D399] shrink-0 mt-0.5" />
            <span><strong>Zero Data Retention:</strong> Nothing is logged, stored, or sent across the internet.</span>
          </div>
          <div class="flex items-start gap-2.5 text-xs text-slate-200">
            <CheckCircle2 class="h-4 w-4 text-[#34D399] shrink-0 mt-0.5" />
            <span><strong>Offline Capable:</strong> Tools run seamlessly even on airplanes or in air-gapped workstations.</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>


    {/* STORY BLOCK 2: Left Text, Right Image */}
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-8 lg:gap-12 items-center">
      
      {/* Left Column: Copy & Narrative */}
      <div class="lg:col-span-6 space-y-5 text-left order-2 lg:order-1">
        <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 text-xs font-mono font-semibold tracking-wider text-amber-400 uppercase">
          <Zap class="h-3.5 w-3.5 text-amber-400" />
          <span>Local Device Performance</span>
        </div>

        <h3 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight text-white leading-tight">
          Native Speed Without Artificial Limits
        </h3>

        <p class="text-sm text-[#94A3B8] leading-relaxed">
          Cloud tools throttle free users with 10MB limits, daily conversion quotas, slow queues, and watermarked downloads to push paid subscriptions.
        </p>

        <p class="text-sm text-[#94A3B8] leading-relaxed">
          By utilizing modern client-side execution and hardware acceleration, NovaTools taps directly into your CPU and GPU. Process large videos, batch documents, and high-resolution images instantly without paywalls.
        </p>

        {/* Feature Checkpoints */}
        <div class="space-y-2.5 pt-2">
          <div class="flex items-start gap-2.5 text-xs text-slate-200">
            <CheckCircle2 class="h-4 w-4 text-[#34D399] shrink-0 mt-0.5" />
            <span><strong>No Upload Delays:</strong> Zero network latency or slow file uploading queues.</span>
          </div>
          <div class="flex items-start gap-2.5 text-xs text-slate-200">
            <CheckCircle2 class="h-4 w-4 text-[#34D399] shrink-0 mt-0.5" />
            <span><strong>Free & Unbounded:</strong> Full access to all 21+ tools with no file size quotas.</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      {/* Right Column: Real Application Screenshot */}
      <div class="lg:col-span-6 relative group order-1 lg:order-2">
        <div class="relative rounded-2xl border border-white/10 bg-[#0A0F1D]/80 backdrop-blur-xl p-2 sm:p-2.5 shadow-2xl shadow-indigo-950/30 overflow-hidden transition-all duration-300 group-hover:border-indigo-500/30">
          {/* Subtle Window Header */}
          <div class="flex items-center gap-1.5 px-3 py-2 border-b border-white/5 bg-[#050811]/60 rounded-t-xl mb-1.5">
            <span class="h-2.5 w-2.5 rounded-full bg-red-500/60" />
            <span class="h-2.5 w-2.5 rounded-full bg-amber-500/60" />
            <span class="h-2.5 w-2.5 rounded-full bg-emerald-500/60" />
            <span class="ml-2 font-mono text-[10px] text-slate-400">novatools.app/image/background-remover</span>
          </div>

          <img
            src="/screenshots/3_novatools_bg_remover_diff.jpg"
            alt="NovaTools AI Background Remover Studio"
            class="w-full h-auto rounded-xl object-cover border border-white/5 shadow-inner"
            loading="lazy"
          />
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>

  </div>
</section>
